sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Modeler as 👤 Modeler / Analyst

    box rgb(219,234,254) Presentation Layer
        participant FE as Sim-Engine Frontend (React SPA)
    end

    box rgb(224,231,255) Application Layer — Spring Boot
        participant BE as Sim-Engine Backend (API Gateway)
        participant ORCH as Snapshot Orchestrator (Spring Batch)
    end

    box rgb(254,243,199) Compute Layer
        participant CE as Calculation Engine (JVM Service)
    end

    box rgb(220,252,231) Data Layer
        participant ODB as DW / Operational DB (Oracle RDBMS)
        participant SDB as Snapshot DB (Analytics RDBMS)
    end

    box rgb(255,228,230) Phase 2 — Future Scope
        participant KQ as Kafka Queue (compacted topic)
        participant P2DB as Phase-2 Target DB (Data Lake)
    end

    %% ── Phase 1: Simulation job trigger ──────────────────────────────────────
    Note over Modeler,SDB: ⚙️ Phase 1 — Current Year (2026)

    Modeler->>FE: Open browser · HTTPS TLS 1.3
    FE->>BE: HTTPS / REST — submit system-id + params
    activate BE

    BE->>ORCH: Kafka topic: job-commands · SnapshotJob event (Avro)
    activate ORCH

    ORCH->>CE: gRPC unary / streaming · job contract + config
    activate CE

    CE->>ODB: JDBC / SQL streaming · server-side cursor · fetch 1M × 50 cols
    activate ODB
    ODB-->>CE: Chunked SQL result · batched rows
    deactivate ODB

    CE->>SDB: Bulk insert · ~450 MB / 1M rows × 50 cols
    activate SDB
    SDB-->>CE: Insert ACK
    deactivate SDB

    CE-->>ORCH: Job complete (row count + checksum)
    deactivate CE

    ORCH-->>BE: Async callback · SnapshotReady event
    deactivate ORCH

    BE-->>FE: WebSocket / SSE · job status 100% ✅
    deactivate BE

    %% ── Read paths ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    Note over FE,SDB: 📖 Read paths — serve UI and direct BI access

    FE->>BE: HTTPS / REST — request snapshot data
    activate BE
    BE->>SDB: JDBC read replica · serve UI + export
    SDB-->>BE: Query result
    BE-->>FE: JSON response
    deactivate BE

    Modeler-->>SDB: SQL / BI tool · direct read-only query
    SDB-->>Modeler: Result set

    %% ── Phase 2 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    Note over BE,P2DB: 🔮 Phase 2 — Future Scope (not in 2026 roadmap)

    BE->>SDB: JDBC · read snapshot for publishing
    SDB-->>BE: Snapshot data
    BE-)KQ: Kafka publish · Avro + schema registry · snapshot pointer + metadata
    KQ-)P2DB: Kafka Connect / Sink · at-least-once delivery
